# {{ title }} (extension module)

{{ description }}

An extension is a secondary product that lives in this codebase but is used **outside the ERP**:

- Own panel: `/{{ slug }}` (or its own domain via `{{ SLUG_ENV }}_PANEL_DOMAIN`)
- Own API: `/api/{{ slug }}/…` (`routes/api.php`)
- Access: allow the dashboard on 従業員カテゴリ or individual users (共通管理), same user accounts
- Toggle: `MODULE_{{ SLUG_ENV }}_ENABLED=false`

It may use the Core kernel (numbering, money, users). It must **not** depend on ERP business modules;
if it needs ERP data, read it through an Application service exposed by that module.
